Description: Functions for parameterising and predicting models of the
    oviposition cycle of Anopheles mosquitoes, to quantify how vector
    bionomics influence the impact of vector control interventions against
    malaria, and to parameterise the entomology and vector control of
    OpenMalaria scenarios. Refactoring of the AnophelesModel package.
